#. module: nudge
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:nudge.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"A small model (multilingual-e5-small, about 135 MB in the filestore, "
"downloaded from https://huggingface.co/Xenova/multilingual-e5-small) that "
"runs on the CPU of this server. It re-ranks the documentation, the company "
"files and the remembered answers by meaning, and finds an English page for a"
" question in Arabic. No AI provider is involved and nothing leaves the "
"server, so private mode does not stop it. It needs the Python packages "
"onnxruntime and tokenizers. Not covered: the records of other models. "
"Memory: while it is loaded, each Odoo process that answered a question holds"
" about 450 MB (the model and its vocabulary), and the process that indexes "
"about 600 MB; plan 0.5 GB per worker that serves searches. The model is "
"loaded at the first question, shared by all the databases of a process, and "
"dropped after the idle time below."
msgstr ""
"نموذج صغير (multilingual-e5-small، نحو 135 ميغابايت في filestore، يُنزَّل من"
" https://huggingface.co/Xenova/multilingual-e5-small) يعمل على معالج هذا "
"الخادم. يعيد ترتيب التوثيق وملفات الشركة والإجابات المحفوظة بحسب المعنى، "
"ويجد صفحة إنجليزية لسؤال بالعربية. لا حاجة إلى مزوّد ذكاء اصطناعي."

