"An answer liked by enough different people becomes a Suggested reference, "
"for a manager to approve with one click. Nothing is served before that yes. "
"Off: only a manager's thumbs-up and Save as reference keep answers."
msgstr ""
"الإجابة التي يعجب بها عدد كافٍ من الأشخاص المختلفين تصبح مرجعًا مقترحًا "
